abstract: >-
  An adaptive learning app for kids on Cloudflare Workers, built on the Marble Skill Taxonomy.
  Designed by Kent Langley and Landon; developed with Grok Bot, an AI assistant, which wrote and
  iterated on the code, content and docs from their feedback and acts as the nightly lesson author.
